        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**🇬🇧 English**\n\n**Weather No Freeze !** the successor to **Forecast**, **WeatherBoard**, **Asteroid**, and **WeatherGround** is finally here for iOS 16 !\n\nStops the Weather wallpaper from freezing on your Lock Screen & Home Screen and even more !",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "🛒 <b>Havoc shop :</b><br><a href=\"https://havoc.app/package/weathernofreeze\" style=\"color:#1F7AFF\">https://havoc.app/package/weathernofreeze</a>",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "# ***Features* :**",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**• Unfreeze the Weather wallpaper :**\n- Disables the freezing of the animations on the Weather wallpaper (Lock Screen & Home Screen).\n\n**• Animation speed :**\n- Adjust the speed with a slider, up to 10 times faster ! (The iOS default is 1.00).\n\n**• Simulate the weather you want :**\n- Force any weather condition (48 to choose from, or keep your local weather).\n- Force the sky background to Auto, Day or Night.\n\n**• Weather widgets on the Lock Screen :**\n- Display the real Weather widgets with real-time weather on your Lock Screen : Today's forecast, 5-day forecast, or both at once.\n- Turn each widget on or off separately, and adjust the height of the widget with a slider.\n\n**• Lock Screen backlight :**\n- Customize or disable the Auto-Lock delay of the Lock Screen (The delay resets when you touch or unlock the screen).\n\n**• 10 languages :**\n\nEnglish, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Dutch, Russian, Simplified Chinese and Japanese.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "# ***Settings live in* :**",
